# "Assimilate a creature card exiled with it" takes only a creature card: Bot2 discards an Island to hand size on turn 2,
# the Assessor's entry trigger exiles that graveyard on turn 3, and when it attacks on turn 5 the pile holds the Island
# alone. Nothing is assimilated and nothing is asked (CR 608.2d): the Island stays in exile and the Assessor deals 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Sol Ring
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Assimilation Assessor
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Graveyard = Island
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Assimilation Assessor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Island
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Assimilation Assessor > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 15

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Assimilation Assessor; Mox Jet; Sol Ring; Swamp
Exile = Island
